\u00e4ltetechnik) spielerisch entdecken und erste berufstypische Aufgaben ausprobieren. Ob Technik, Gesundheit oder Handwerk \u2013 finde heraus, was dir am meisten Spa\u00df macht! :)\n\nEarly Access: Sei unter den Ersten, die jobVRiety testen!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "3902217326706597", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_3902217330039930_1240378813803928232_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xu9g_5vFEFkQ7kNvwF3LpdC&_nc_oc=AdoNM8lFOAVEIX7Vc24hq1v1sd5GW8Fl3P6Z7vi3D4s5goaie9jmcmJkKFjy-UEf08Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRsSJUtEHCEDhxuApph-n_xR-TV5087A9WoEILZlEp8PA&oe=6AFF2BF6"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_1080x360.png", "id": "3076099412552471", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825091_3076099415885804_5417180118801740963_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=407zhyZAty0Q7kNvwEJgW99&_nc_oc=Adqk7eSFx5V1qK0EcBzueeFRhzCKZkd239Gilf6E20WdWOXej-yj7rePRCUmZOU2lU0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTvwCD_6LpCy4y7e9Ba3F-uerMkR10yHMiQVE9BCP0t4A&oe=6AFF27F6"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateSquare_1440x1440.png", "id": "2448391595528830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824609_2448391598862163_943533169723644988_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=epMHMnBuV-EQ7kNvwEuT2Ji&_nc_oc=AdqLLUxHuatnsXXSrCO6isvWBAnIWcrZbShPHCijmb1pOQPToSW_eklxaFCFlFDpctA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSTCy8-vPADAjWfcdkDbbSQqijQItDZWvft-MeMOtQrTg&oe=6AFF2C7E"}, {"file_name": "JobVR_LogoClaim_rgb.png", "id": "1748084809102207", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "u